{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While Ray tracing graphics cards\u00a0<u><strong>are not</strong></u> necessary to play this game, it is highly recommended to have a graphics card that supports this technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Confirmed to be playable on Linux utilizing Fedora Linux with Proton.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow the introspective dream adventure of a 10-year-old blind child, who five years ago completely lost not only their sight but also the warmth of their beloved mother.<br>As the years went by, a feeling of emptiness embraced the child after noticing something very important was missing. No matter how hard they tried, <i><strong>they couldn't remember their mother's face at all.</strong></i><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras/a7d1f9009024c47dcdf62e5f7aaf42b3.avif?t=1769248760\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate surreal dreamscapes while exploring fragments of past memories, following the red flowery path that leads to her forgotten features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras/a1378f2bcc11b4b5cd37dfa299748466.avif?t=1769248760\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras_big/a1378f2bcc11b4b5cd37dfa299748466.webp?t=1769248760 width=1560 height=878 /></span>Each dream reveals more than just distant echoes of their mother\u2019s voice, more than long gone memories, they unveil how meaningful spending time with their mother was to built who they are at present.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras/a3fc9e0d7fbee7e7450ec7676923e4be.avif?t=1769248760\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras_big/a3fc9e0d7fbee7e7450ec7676923e4be.webp?t=1769248760 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep going deeper into the subconscious dream world. But watch out,\u00a0<br><strong>you may not like what you will find.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras/5f6198fad8c1247262ea8f9a39aa8cc1.avif?t=1769248760\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/extras_big/5f6198fad8c1247262ea8f9a39aa8cc1.webp?t=1769248760 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101940?t=1769248760","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101940?t=1769248760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/4bc2081548657a88411a2fd3980ea327f744949e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769248760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101940/4bc2081548657a88411a2fd3980ea327f744949e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769248760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4202690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While Ray tracing graphics cards\u00a0<u><strong>are not</strong></u> necessary to play this game, it is highly recommended to have a graphics card that supports this technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Confirmed to be p